specs/hal-engine-subprotocol-marker/spec.md-40-| Upgrade request headers                                     | `Sec-WebSocket-Protocol`, `Authorization`, `Cookie`, as the client sent them    | the request; any header capture |
specs/hal-engine-subprotocol-marker/spec.md:41:| The connected socket's `authHeaders`                        | `authorization` (`Bearer <token>`), `cookie`, `host`                            | the connection                  |
